  (text "CP2105 / J400 / J401" (at 203.2 115.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "efff3f43-ddff-45f1-a2a9-03606df986de"))
  (text "INTEGRATION / BRING-UP" (at 12.7 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7c6ff256-5fd5-46c2-80df-f10416c52807"))
  (text "USB-only OR carrier-only; never both: UART is shared.\nCarrier GPIO/pull-ups Hi-Z while 3V3_R is off.\nJ400.8 reset: open-drain LOW only; never drive HIGH.\nOTP: 1V8 at 0 ms -> 1V0 at 2 ms -> 3V3/1V2 at 5 ms.\nPGOOD: reset release 10..13 ms after rails settle.\nCheck full-chirp PGOOD, reset-before-rail-fall, UART injection." (at 12.7 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0b2b1cba-6d4b-4d18-92c5-8e1a4d39eb9a"))
  (text "BOOT / DEBUG" (at 160.02 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ed8ee66e-f48a-43f3-8318-9e2e6d5ed03a"))
  (text "SOP2/1/0: 001 QSPI; 101 UART flash; 011 JTAG.\nSet straps with reset LOW; release BOOT in carrier mode.\nFlash: hold RESET + BOOT; release RESET, then BOOT.\nJP300 open = normal; bridged = SOP1 HIGH (debug).\nUniFlash: USB Enhanced port; JTAG start at 1 MHz.\nJ301 VTref sense only; probe target power OFF." (at 160.02 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f2741fcc-6e38-42c6-8a57-0b60ae9ad1ec"))
